<xliff
    xmlns="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2" version="1.2">
    <file source-language="en" datatype="plaintext" original="messages">
        <body>
            <trans-unit id="mlang_labels_tablabel">
                <source>Error hints</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="mlang_tabs_tab">
                <source>Error hints</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="mlang_labels_tabdescr">
                <source>The newest logged errors, with a model's hint for the likely cause on request</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="heading">
                <source>Logged errors</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="intro">
                <source>The newest error entries from the TYPO3 log files. A hint sends the exception class, the component, the stack frames without their arguments and, where the provider's trust zone allows it, the message with credentials in URLs masked to the configuration chosen below; no source code is sent.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="configuration">
                <source>Hints are asked from: %s</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="noConfiguration">
                <source>There is no default LLM configuration and none is chosen, so no hint can be asked for.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="empty">
                <source>No error-level entries in the TYPO3 log files.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="ask">
                <source>Ask for a hint</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="hint">
                <source>Hint</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="hintGuess">
                <source>Hint (a guess: it points at no frame in the project's own code)</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="cause">
                <source>Likely cause</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="nextStep">
                <source>Next step</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="frame">
                <source>Frame</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="messageWithheld">
                <source>Made without the message: the provider's trust zone does not admit exception messages.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="openCard">
                <source>Open error hints</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="entryGone">
                <source>The chosen error is no longer among the ten newest; no model was asked. Choose it again from the list below.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="noHint">
                <source>No hint:</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="refusal.zone_admits_no_diagnostics">
                <source>The configuration "%s" may not receive system diagnostics: its provider, or a fallback it can reach, is in an external trust zone. No model was asked.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="refusal.nothing_to_send">
                <source>The entry records no exception class and no stack, and the provider may not receive its message; there is nothing to ask about.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="refusal.call_failed">
                <source>The model call failed: %s</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="refusal.unreadable_answer">
                <source>The model did not answer in the expected form.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="refusal.no_configuration">
                <source>There is no LLM configuration to ask.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="refusal.configuration_inactive">
                <source>The LLM configuration "%s" is deactivated; no model was asked.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="action.zone">
                <source>What you can do: choose a configuration above whose provider is local or privately hosted, or, if this provider may receive error details, move it to one of those trust zones.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="action.configuration">
                <source>What you can do: choose an active configuration above, or create or activate one.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="link.configurations">
                <source>Configurations</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="link.providers">
                <source>Providers</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="choice.heading">
                <source>Configuration for hints</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="choice.label">
                <source>Ask hints from</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="choice.default">
                <source>The default configuration</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="choice.save">
                <source>Use this configuration</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="choice.help">
                <source>The choice is kept for your backend user. A hint is only asked of a configuration whose provider, and every fallback it can reach, is local or privately hosted; the trust zone is set on the provider.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="choice.dropped">
                <source>The configuration you chose is gone or deactivated; the default configuration is used until you choose another.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="choice.refused">
                <source>That configuration is not active; the choice was not changed.</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="admission.full">
                <source>(allowed: class, stack and message)</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="admission.without_message">
                <source>(allowed without the message)</source>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="admission.none">
                <source>(not allowed: external trust zone)</source>
            </trans-unit>
        </body>
    </file>
</xliff>
